{"id":"914e23e8288c2eb2","subject":"go:golang.org/x/tools","time":"2026-10-10T00:00:00Z","clock":{"version":"0.52.0"},"statement":"`golang.org/x/tools/go/analysis/passes/modernize` now includes analyzers for Go 1.26-era rewrites, including `modernize.NewExprAnalyzer` (suggesting `new(expr)`), `modernize.StdIteratorsAnalyzer` (using iterator APIs instead of Len/At-style APIs), `modernize.StringsSeqAnalyzer` (using `SplitSeq`/`FieldsSeq`), and `modernize.WaitGroupGoAnalyzer` (replacing `WaitGroup.Add`/goroutine/`Done` patterns with `WaitGroup.Go`); for example, include `modernize.NewExprAnalyzer` in an analyzer driver to apply its suggested modernization fixes.","source":"https://go.googlesource.com/tools/+/refs/tags/v0.52.0/go/analysis/passes/modernize/doc.go","added":"2026-10-29T22:46:45.118721343Z","by":"agent"}
